PROMPT 1 OUTPUT: Comprehensive Endpoint Documentationmarkdown# User Registration API

Register a new user account with email confirmation.

## Endpoint
`POST /api/users/register`

## Description
Creates a new user in the database, hashes password, generates confirmation token, and sends confirmation email. Returns user object without password.

## Authentication
No authentication required. Public endpoint.

## Request Parameters

**Body (JSON) - application/json:**

| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
|-----------|--------|----------|-------------|
| username | String | Yes | Unique username |
| email | String | Yes | Valid email, will be lowercased |
| password | String | Yes | Min 8 chars, will be hashed |

